* NMOS Transistors
M1 5 2 2 2 NMOS_MODEL
M2 4 2 2 2 NMOS_MODEL
M51 2 2 7 7 NMOS_MODEL
M52 2 2 7 7 NMOS_MODEL

* PMOS Transistors
M3 5 3 3 3 PMOS_MODEL
M4 4 1 3 3 PMOS_MODEL

* Voltage Sources
VDD 3 0 DC VDD_VALUE
VSS 7 0 DC -VSS_VALUE

* Other Connections
VB1 2 0 DC VBB2_VALUE
V1 2 0 DC VI1_VALUE
V2 2 0 DC VI2_VALUE
VBIAS 6 4 DC VBIAS_VALUE
VCMC 2 0 DC VCMC_VALUE

.MODEL NMOS_MODEL NMOS (LEVEL=1)
.MODEL PMOS_MODEL PMOS (LEVEL=1)